{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119830/extras/f992e4b610d346ea5f5d1fefc68d6e25.avif?t=1761817390\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Holiday Story - is a short horror game about Christmas and New Year, set in the late 1980s. The game's main genre is &quot;Horror&quot;, &quot;Walking simulator&quot;.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Plot:</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an ordinary man on your way home from a business trip.<br>You promised your son a construction set for Christmas \u2014 but never got the chance to buy it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stopping by a brightly lit toy, electronics, and video game store, you step inside, hoping to find the perfect gift\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But soon, strange things begin to happen in the beautifully decorated Christmas shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119830/extras/fd1666855f5c702e01ae4ad7d4af2a52.poster.avif?t=1761817390\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119830/extras/fd1666855f5c702e01ae4ad7d4af2a52.webm?t=1761817390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119830/extras/fd1666855f5c702e01ae4ad7d4af2a52.mp4?t=1761817390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Features:</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS aesthetics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy yet unsettling holiday atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro 1980s setting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic sound design.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Estimated playtime: 30\u201340 minutes.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4119830?t=1761817390","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119830/6b5cf00245bd1e499d731660ae000cf81545da1c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761817390","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119830/7b28f3144304b71467a88bca13af90ac7371367d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761817390","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119830/7b28f3144304b71467a88bca13af90ac7371367d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761817390","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119830/extras/f992e4b610d346ea5f5d1fefc68d6e25.avif?t=1761817390\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Holiday Story - is a short horror game about Christmas and New Year, set in the late 1980s. The game's main genre is &quot;Horror&quot;, &quot;Walking simulator&quot;.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Plot:</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an ordinary man on your way home from a business trip.<br>You promised your son a construction set for Christmas \u2014 but never got the chance to buy it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stopping by a brightly lit toy, electronics, and video game store, you step inside, hoping to find the perfect gift\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragra